figuration and automated filing; 3) Sales and Receivables - management of customer data, sales orders, and reporting; 4) Purchase and Payables - vendor management and purchase processes; 5) Inventory and Warehouse Management - tracking across multiple locations and stock management; 6) Operations and Field Service - route planning and technician tracking; 7) Sales, Marketing, and Business Development - CRM for managing vending locations; 8) Project Planning and Management - project tracking and collaboration; 9) Manpower Management - integration with KEKA and management of employee data; 10) CRM and Customer Support - centralized database and complaint tracking; 11) Reporting and Analytics - consolidated dashboards and KPI tracking; 12) Integrations - connecting with TeleVend, Google Maps, KEKA HRMS, and banking systems.","scope_of_work":null,"scope_of_work_introduction":null,"scope_of_work_summary":null,"start_date":"2026-01-28","status":"failed","submitted_to":["Mr. Zara"],"subscription_id":"b969f7e3-6f6d-4ca7-9340-43bf0e9844ef","summary":"The proposal outlines the implementation of a fully integrated Zoho business management system for FreshNow, aimed at consolidating various business functions including finance, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, and HR. The primary objective is to enhance data visibility, improve operational efficiency, and facilitate informed decision-making across the organization. The implementation will cover multiple modules, each focusing on specific business areas such as financial management, VAT compliance, sales and receivables, purchasing, inventory management, operations, CRM, project management, manpower management, customer support, reporting, and integrations with existing systems.","team_members":[{"experience":"3","role":"Project Manager"}],"team_structure_min_experience":null,"team_structure_table":null,"template_id":"dfccc9d2-4ed3-44f8-a847-9704c277c264","title":"Scope of Work for Zoho Implementation (Fre