nancial workflows, and VAT configuration","timeline":"4 weeks"},{"phase":"Phase 2: Sales, Purchase, Inventory & CRM","scope":"Implementation of sales processes, purchase orders, inventory management, and CRM setup","timeline":"4 weeks"},{"phase":"Phase 3: Integrations & Analytics","scope":"Integration of TeleVend and other analytics tools, setup of dashboards","timeline":"4 weeks"},{"phase":"Phase 4: Operations & Field Service (Phase 2)","scope":"Implementation of field service management and operations workflows","timeline":"4 weeks"},{"phase":"Phase 5: HR Migration & Final Go-Live","scope":"Migration of HR data, integration of HR workflows, and final system go-live","timeline":"4 weeks"}],"industry":"Food & Beverage / Vending Operations","is_deleted":false,"links":["https://www.zoho.com"],"milestones":[{"date":"2025-02-28","title":"Financials, VAT, and Core Setup"},{"date":"2025-03-31","title":"Sales, Purchase, Inventory & CRM"},{"date":"2025-04-30","title":"Integrations & Analytics"},{"date":"2025-05-31","title":"Operations & Field Service (Phase 2)"},{"date":"2025-06-30","title":"HR Migration & Final Go-Live"}],"objectives":"The primary objectives of this project are to centralize FreshNow's operations, enhance data visibility across all departments, automate key business processes, and empower management with the tools necessary for informed decision-making.","parent_id":null,"pinecone_namespace":"proposal-22b9f8d7-1c1d-44f2-8ce5-f78a1619ddbb","rejection_reason":"bad sadASDsdASD","rendered_pdf_url":null,"retention_date":null,"scope":"Implementation of finance, VAT, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, HR, integrations, and analytics using Zoho ecosystem","scope_of_work":"# Scope of Work for Zoho Implementation\n\n## 1. Objective\nImplement a fully integrated Zoho business management system covering finance, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, and HR to consolidate functions for data visibility, efficiency, and informed decisions.\n\n## 2. Modules and Functional Scope\n### A. Financial Management\n- Chart of accounts setup\n- Accounts receivable and payable management\n- Cash and bank transactions with reconciliation\n- Budgeting and cost center tracking\n- Fixed asset management\n- Multi-currency and VAT compliant accounting (UAE)\n- Dashboards for cash flow, margins, P&L\n\n### B. VAT and Compliance\n- VAT configuration (UAE FTA compliant)\n- Automated VAT return filing and reporting\n- VAT audit trail and reconciliation\n\n### C. Sales and Receivables\n- Customer master and credit control\n- Sales order, delivery, invoice management\n- Automatic TeleVend data sync (vending machines)\n- Real-time customer-wise sales reporting\n- Approval workflows for discounts and returns\n\n### D. Purchase and Payables\n- Vendor management\n- Purchase requisition, approval, PO process\n- Goods receipt and purchase return tracking\n- Expense allocation and vendor reconciliation\n- Supplier performance analytics\n\n### E. Inventory and Warehouse Management\n- Multi-location inventory tracking (warehouse, vans, machines)\n- Stock transfers and adjustments\n- Batch and serial number tracking with expiry\n- Stock level alerts and refill planning\n- Integration with TeleVend for real-time machine stock\n\n### F. Operations and Field Service (Phase 2)\n- Field route planning and optimization (Google Maps)\n- Machine service scheduling and history\n- Technician task tracking with photo capture\n- Ticket creation from TeleVend alerts\n- Asset tracking (tools, crates, spare parts)\n\n### G. Sales, Marketing, Business Development\n- CRM to manage 90+ vending locations and accounts\n- Contract management for onboarding, renewal, termination, SLA\n- Location review workflow and approval\n- Account segmentation\n- Opportunity tracking and campaign management\n\n### H. Project Planning and Management\n- Project and campaign planning with milestones and budget\n- Technical and operational project tracking\n- Task assignment and progress tracking\n- Team collaboration with file sharing\n\n### I. Manpower Management\n- Phase 1: Integrate KEKA with Zoho (attendance, payroll, employee data)\n- Phase 2: Migrate to Zoho People\n\n### J. Reporting and Analytics\n- Consolidated dashboards across departments\n- KPI tracking: revenue, uptime, stock efficiency, satisfaction\n- Forecasting dashboards and custom visual reports\n\n## 3. Deliverables\n- Zoho Books configuration with UAE VAT compliance\n- Sales, purchase, and inventory workflow automation\n- TeleVend integration for real-time vending data\n- CRM setup for vending locations and accounts\n- Operational and field service management (Phase 2)\n- HR integration with KEKA and migration to Zoho People\n- Project management and collaboration setup\n- Consolidated dashboards and analytics\n\n## 4. Milestones\n- **Financials, VAT, and Core Setup**: 2025-02-28\n- **Sales, Purchase, Inventory & CRM**: 2025-03-31\n- **Integrations & Analytics**: 2025-04-30\n- **Operations & Field Service (Phase 2)**: 2025-05-31\n- **HR Migration & Final Go-Live**: 2025-06-30\n\n## 5. Timeline\n- **Start Date**: 2025-02-01\n- **End Date**: 2025-06-30","scope_of_work_introduction":"This scope of work outlines the comprehensive implementation plan for the Zoho business management system tailored for FreshNow Management. The goal is to centralize operations, enhance data visibility, and automate processes to facilitate informed decision-making in the food and beverage vending industry.","scope_of_work_summary":"The implementation of the Zoho ecosystem will cover various modules including finance, VAT management, sales, purchasing, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, HR integration, and analytics. Deliverables will include fully configured systems compliant with UAE regulations, automated workflows, and real-time data integration to improve operational efficiency.","start_date":"2025-02-01","status":"rejected","submitted_to":["FreshNow"],"subscription_id":"b969f7e3-6f6d-4ca7-9340-43bf0e9844ef","summary":"End-to-end Zoho business management system implementation for FreshNow","team_members":[{"experience":"8+ years","role":"Zoho Solution Architect"},{"experience":"6+ years","role":"Zoho Finance Consultant"},{"experience":"5+ years","role":"Zoho CRM & Creator Developer"},{"experience":"7+ years","role":"Project Manager"}],"team_structure_min_experience":5,"team_structure_table":[{"Count":"1","Designation":"Zoho Solution Architect","Experience":"8","Key Responsibilities":"Lead the design and implementation of the Zoho solution, ensuring alignment with business goals."},{"Count":"1","Designation":"Zoho Finance Consultant","Experience":"6","Key Responsibilities":"Configure Zoho Books for finance management and ensure VAT compliance."},{"Count":"1","Designation":"Zoho CRM & Creator Developer","Experience":"5","Key Responsibilities":"Develop and customize CRM solutions for vending locations and accounts."},{"Count":"1","Designation":"Project Manager","Experience":"7","Key Responsibilities":"Oversee project execution, manage timelines, and ensure deliverables meet quality standards."}],"template_id":"3a8e6c41-5c1a-4f8e-9b2a-6d9e2c7f5510","title":"Zoho Implementation Proposal","total_budget":"0","training_and_support":"We will provide comprehensive training sessions tailored to FreshNow's staff to ensure they are well-equipped to use the new Zoho system. Ongoing support will be available through dedicated channels to assist with any queries or issues that may arise post-implementation.","updated_at":"2026-01-16T07:46:52.690Z","updated_by":"9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b","version_number":1},{"approval_comments":"Approved","approved_at":"2026-01-16T07:48:10.316Z","approved_by":"9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b","audio_storage_paths":null,"billing_type":"milestone","client_email":"john.smith@acme.com","client_name":"John Smith","created_at":"2026-01-05T10:23:22.599Z","created_by":"b729e698-222a-42b8-8ae0-31f3ca9d0172