agement systems, ensuring VAT compliance, managing sales and receivables, optimizing purchase processes, tracking inventory, enhancing operations and field service, managing customer relationships, planning and managing projects, integrating manpower management, providing customer support, and delivering robust reporting and analytics.","id":"7617daa3-0689-4ec1-86b2-5c8c121b9a7a","implementation_timeline_table":null,"industry":"Other","is_deleted":false,"links":["https://www.zoho.com"],"milestones":[{"title":"zoho app"}],"objectives":null,"parent_id":null,"pinecone_namespace":null,"rejection_reason":null,"rendered_pdf_url":null,"retention_date":null,"scope":"The scope includes the implementation of various modules: Financial Management (setup of accounts, cash transactions, budgeting, multi-currency accounting), VAT and Compliance (VAT configuration and reporting), Sales and Receivables (customer management, sales order processing), Purchase and Payables (vendor management, purchase requisition), Inventory and Warehouse Management (multi-location tracking, stock adjustments), Operations and Field Service (route planning, technician tracking), Sales, Marketing, and Business Development (CRM management, contract management), Project Planning and Management (project tracking, budget management), Manpower Management (attendance and payroll integration), CRM and Customer Support (centralized database, complaint tracking), Reporting and Analytics (dashboard creation), and Integrations (API connections with TeleVend, Google Maps, KEKA HRMS).","scope_of_work":null,"scope_of_work_introduction":null,"scope_of_work_summary":null,"start_date":"2026-02-01","status":"failed","submitted_to":["Ms. Zara"],"subscription_id":"b969f7e3-6f6d-4ca7-9340-43bf0e9844ef","summary":"The proposal outlines the implementation of a fully integrated Zoho business management system for FreshNow, aimed at consolidating various business functions including finance, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, and HR. The primary objective is to enhance data visibility, improve efficiency, and facilitate informed decision-making. The implementation will be carried out in phases, with a comprehensive scope covering multiple modules such as financial management, VAT compliance, sales and receivables, purchase and payables, inventory management, operations, CRM, project management, manpower management, customer support, reporting, and integrations.","team_members":[{"experience":"2","role":"tester"},{"experience":"4","role":"zoho developer"}],"team_structure_min_experience":null,"team_structure_table":null,"template_id":"dfccc9d2-4ed3-44f8-a847-9704c277c264","title":"Scope of Work for Zoho Implementation (FreshNow)","total_budget":"1000","training_and_support":null,"updated_at":"2026-01-27T10:21:07.104Z","updated_by":null,"version_number":1},{"approval_comments":null,"approved_at":null,"approved_by":null,"audio_storage_paths":["216ea075-72ed-462f-a404-eb49a0918702/9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b/1769068170788-p3pjktpek.mp3"],"billing_type":null,"client_email":null,"client_name":null,"created_at":"2026-01-22T07:48:42.469Z","created_by":"9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b","currency":null,"date_of_proposal":null,"deliverables":["Financial Management","VAT and Compliance","Sales and Receivables","Purchase and Payables","Inventory and Warehouse Management","Operations and Field Service","Sales, Marketing, Business Development","Project Planning and Management","Manpower Management","CRM and Customer Support","Reporting and Analytics","Integrations","Fleet Management","Contract Management","Budgeting and Forecasting"],"document_storage_paths":["216ea075-72ed-462f-a404-eb49a0918702/9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b/1769068120985-nydli1gjm.docx"],"duration_business_days":null,"end_date":null,"executive_summary":null,"extraction_job_id":"20","extraction_progress":100,"extraction_status":"completed","goals":"Consolidate functions in Zoho for data visibility, efficiency, and informed decisions.","id":"c26e20b6-796b-4668-905d-a8af4854118d","implementation_timeline_table":null,"industry":"Other","is_deleted":false,"links":null,"milestones":null,"objectives":null,"parent_id":null,"pinecone_namespace":null,"rejection_reason":null,"rendered_pdf_url":null,"retention_date":null,"scope":"Implementation of various modules including Financial Management, VAT and Compliance, Sales and Receivables, Purchase and Payables, Inventory and Warehouse Management, Operations and Field Service, Sales, Marketing, Business Development, Project Planning and Management, Manpower Management, CRM and Customer Support, Reporting and Analytics, and Integrations. Additionally, integrate KEKA with Zoho for attendance, payroll, and employee data management, and implement a CEO dashboard for visibility across departments.","scope_of_work":null,"scope_of_work_introduction":null,"scope_of_work_summary":null,"start_date":null,"status":"draft","submitted_to":null,"subscription_id":"b969f7e3-6f6d-4ca7-9340-43bf0e9844ef","summary":"Implement a fully integrated Zoho business management system covering finance, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, and HR.","team_members":null,"team_structure_min_experience":null,"team_structure_table":null,"template_id":"dfccc9d2-4ed3-44f8-a847-9704c277c264","title":"Zoho Implementation (FreshNow)","total_budget":null,"training_and_support":null,"updated_at":"2026-01-22T07:52:10.235Z","updated_by":null,"version_number":1},{"approval_comments":null,"approved_at":null,"approved_by":null,"audio_storage_paths":["216ea075-72ed-462f-a404-eb49a0918702/9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b/1769067511727-mldahokym.mp3"],"billing_type":"fixed","client_email":null,"client_name":null,"created_at":"2026-01-22T07:19:12.472Z","created_by":"9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b","currency":"USD","date_of_proposal":null,"deliverables":[],"document_storage_paths":["216ea075-72ed-462f-a404-eb49a0918702/9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b/1769067868775-8xnyty1e5.docx"],"duration_business_days":null,"end_date":null,"executive_summary":null,"extraction_job_id":"18","extraction_progress":100,"extraction_status":"completed","goals":"Consolidate functions in Zoho for data visibility, efficiency, and informed decisions. Additionally, the project aims to reduce costs and achieve profitability while managing everything through the system.","id":"f7026380-0749-47f7-9519-dcb18f37b611","implementation_timeline_table":null,"industry":"Other","is_deleted":false,"links":[],"milestones":[],"objectives":null,"parent_id":null,"pinecone_namespace":null,"rejection_reason":null,"rendered_pdf_url":null,"retention_date":null,"scope":"Modules include Financial Management, VAT and Compliance, Sales and Receivables, Purchase and Payables, Inventory and Warehouse Management, Operations and Field Service, Sales, Marketing, Business Development, Project Planning and Management, Manpower Management, CRM and Customer Support, Reporting and Analytics, and Integrations. The implementation will focus on asset management, fleet management, budgeting and forecasting, contract management, and the integration of AI for enhanced operational efficiency. The project will also involve creating dashboards for each department head, automating processes, and utilizing AI for forecasting and decision-making. Specific functionalities include multi-currency and VAT compliant accounting, automated VAT return filing, real-time sales reporting, vendor management, multi-location inventory tracking, field route planning, contract management, and performance KPIs. Additionally, the project will include automated workflows for approvals, a centralized customer database, and integration with various Zoho applications to streamline operations.","scope_of_work":null,"scope_of_work_introduction":null,"scope_of_work_summary":null,"start_date":null,"status":"draft","submitted_to":[],"subscription_id":"b969f7e3-6f6d-4ca7-9340-43bf0e9844ef","summ