[00:07:19.039] Browser LOG     [API Client] Response data: {"approval_comments":null,"approved_at":null,"approved_by":null,"audio_storage_paths":["216ea075-72ed-462f-a404-eb49a0918702/9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b/1769573520445-ua3gyxx2a.mp3"],"billing_type":null,"client_email":null,"client_name":"FreshNow","created_at":"2026-01-28T04:11:11.747Z","created_by":"9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b","currency":null,"date_of_proposal":null,"deliverables":["Chart of accounts setup","Accounts receivable and payable management","Cash and bank transactions with reconciliation","Budgeting and cost center tracking","Fixed asset management","Multi currency and VAT compliant accounting","Dashboards for cash flow, margins, P&L","VAT configuration","Automated VAT return filing and reporting","VAT audit trail and reconciliation","Customer master and credit control","Sales order, delivery, invoice management","Automatic TeleVend data sync","Real time customer wise sales reporting","Approval workflows for discounts and returns","Vendor management","Purchase requisition, approval, PO process","Goods receipt and purchase return tracking","Expense allocation and vendor reconciliation","Supplier performance analytics","Multi location inventory tracking","Stock transfers and adjustments","Batch and serial number tracking with expiry","Stock level alerts and refill planning","Integration with TeleVend for real time machine stock","Cost per cup analysis","Field route planning and optimization","Machine service scheduling and history","Technician task tracking with photo capture","Ticket creation from TeleVend alerts","Asset tracking","Performance KPIs per route and operator","CRM to manage vending locations and accounts","Contract management for onboarding, renewal, termination","Location review workflow and approval","Account segmentation","Opportunity tracking","Campaign management and outreach","Integration with finance and inventory for quotation to invoice","Project and campaign planning with milestones and budget","Technical and operational project tracking","Task assignment and progress tracking","Team collaboration with file sharing","Budget vs actual cost tracking","Attendance and leave management","Shift scheduling and route assignments","Payroll processing","Field staff geo tracking and productivity","Appraisal and feedback cycles","Centralized customer and lead database","Complaint and feedback tracking","Automated escalation matrix","Email, WhatsApp, or call tracking","Consolidated dashboards across departments","KPI tracking: revenue, uptime, stock efficiency, satisfaction","Forecasting dashboards","Custom visual reports and role based access","TeleVend API integration","Google Maps integration","KEKA HRMS integration","Bank feeds integration","Email automation integration","Fleet management system integration","Asset management tracking","Contract management workflows"],"document_storage_paths":["216ea075-72ed-462f-a404-eb49a0918702/9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b/1769573470940-a8pfawv6e.docx"],"duration_business_days":null,"end_date":null,"executive_summary":null,"extraction_job_id":"37","extraction_progress":100,"extraction_status":"completed","goals":"The primary objective is to implement a fully integrated Zoho business management system that consolidates functions for improved data visibility and operational efficiency. Specific goals include ensuring compliance with UAE VAT regulations, enhancing sales and inventory management, optimizing operations and field service, improving manpower management through integration with existing systems, and achieving cost reduction to improve profitability.","id":"fa7bd842-4f22-40f5-bda5-d9a4d42b6e87","implementation_timeline_table":null,"industry":"Other","is_deleted":false,"links":[],"milestones":[],"objectives":null,"parent_id":null,"pinecone_namespace":null,"rejection_reason":null,"rendered_pdf_url":null,"retention_date":null,"scope":"The scope of work includes the implementation of various modules within the Zoho platform: Financial Management (including accounts management, budgeting, and multi-currency accounting), VAT and Compliance (automated VAT filing), Sales and Receivables (customer management and sales order processing), Purchase and Payables (vendor management and expense tracking), Inventory and Warehouse Management (multi-location tracking and stock alerts), Operations and Field Service (route planning and technician tracking), Sales, Marketing, and Business Development (CRM and contract management), Project Planning and Management (project tracking and collaboration), Manpower Management (attendance and payroll integration), CRM and Customer Support (centralized database and feedback tracking), Reporting and Analytics (KPI tracking and forecasting), and Integrations (with TeleVend, Google Maps, and KEKA HRMS). Additional phases will include fleet management and asset tracking, ensuring comprehensive oversight of all resources and operational efficiency.","scope_of_work":null,"scope_of_work_introduction":null,"scope_of_work_summary":null,"start_date":null,"status":"draft","submitted_to":[],"subscription_id":"b969f7e3-6f6d-4ca7-9340-43bf0e9844ef","summary":"The proposal outlines the implementation of a fully integrated Zoho business management system for FreshNow, aimed at enhancing data visibility, efficiency, and informed decision-making across various business functions. The implementation will cover finance, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, and HR, ensuring compliance with UAE regulations, particularly in VAT management. The project is divided into multiple modules, each focusing on specific areas such as financial management, sales and receivables, inventory management, and more, utilizing various Zoho applications to achieve comprehensive integration. Additionally, the implementation will include fleet management, asset management, and contract management to streamline operations and improve profitability.","team_members":[],"team_structure_min_experience":null,"team_structure_table":null,"template_id":"dfccc9d2-4ed3-44f8-a847-9704c277c264","title":"Scope of Work for Zoho Implementation (FreshNow)","total_budget":null,"training_and_support":null,"updated_at":"2026-01-28T04:15:42.777Z","updated_by":null,"version_number":1}
