s for improved data visibility and efficiency. Specific objectives include setting up financial management systems, ensuring VAT compliance, managing sales and receivables, optimizing purchase processes, tracking inventory, enhancing operations and field service, managing customer relationships, planning and managing projects, integrating manpower management, providing customer support, and delivering robust reporting and analytics.","id":"7617daa3-0689-4ec1-86b2-5c8c121b9a7a","implementation_timeline_table":null,"industry":"Other","is_deleted":false,"links":["https://www.zoho.com"],"milestones":[{"title":"zoho app"}],"objectives":null,"parent_id":null,"pinecone_namespace":null,"rejection_reason":null,"rendered_pdf_url":null,"retention_date":null,"scope":"The scope includes the implementation of various modules: Financial Management (setup of accounts, cash transactions, budgeting, multi-currency accounting), VAT and Compliance (VAT configuration and reporting), Sales and Receivables (customer management, sales order processing), Purchase and Payables (vendor management, purchase requisition), Inventory and Warehouse Management (multi-location tracking, stock adjustments), Operations and Field Service (route planning, technician tracking), Sales, Marketing, and Business Development (CRM management, contract management), Project Planning and Management (project tracking, budget management), Manpower Management (attendance and payroll integration), CRM and Customer Support (centralized database, complaint tracking), Reporting and Analytics (dashboard creation), and Integrations (API connections with TeleVend, Google Maps, KEKA HRMS).","scope_of_work":null,"scope_of_work_introduction":null,"scope_of_work_summary":null,"start_date":"2026-02-01","status":"failed","submitted_to":["Ms. Zara"],"subscription_id":"b969f7e3-6f6d-4ca7-9340-43bf0e9844ef","summary":"The proposal outlines the implementation of a fully integrated Zoho business management system for FreshNow, aimed 