[00:42:06.092] Browser LOG     [API Client] Response data: {"approval_comments":null,"approved_at":null,"approved_by":null,"audio_storage_paths":["216ea075-72ed-462f-a404-eb49a0918702/9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b/1769575651394-ehqyzwvmb.mp3"],"billing_type":null,"client_email":null,"client_name":"FreshNow","created_at":"2026-01-28T04:46:59.242Z","created_by":"9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b","currency":null,"date_of_proposal":null,"deliverables":["Financial Management setup including chart of accounts and dashboards","VAT configuration and automated return filing","Sales and receivables management system","Purchase and payables management system","Inventory and warehouse management system","Operations and field service management system","Sales, marketing, and business development CRM","Project planning and management tools","Manpower management integration with KEKA","CRM and customer support system","Reporting and analytics dashboards","Integrations with TeleVend API, Google Maps, KEKA HRMS, and banking systems","Fleet management system for vehicle tracking and maintenance scheduling","Asset management module for tracking machines and resources","Automated approval workflows for contract management and refunds"],"document_storage_paths":["216ea075-72ed-462f-a404-eb49a0918702/9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b/1769575617824-f8sce5ymv.docx"],"duration_business_days":null,"end_date":null,"executive_summary":null,"extraction_job_id":"39","extraction_progress":100,"extraction_status":"completed","goals":"The primary objective is to implement a fully integrated Zoho system that consolidates functions for improved data visibility and efficiency. Specific goals include setting up financial management systems, ensuring VAT compliance, managing sales and receivables, optimizing purchase and payables processes, enhancing inventory and warehouse management, improving operations and field service capabilities, strengthening sales, marketing, and business development efforts, streamlining project planning and management, and enhancing manpower management and customer support functionalities. Furthermore, the project aims to reduce costs, improve profitability, and establish a comprehensive dashboard for each department head.","id":"9a43f7cb-1ff3-473d-a542-b7a3d9031c0a","implementation_timeline_table":null,"industry":"Other","is_deleted":false,"links":[],"milestones":[],"objectives":null,"parent_id":null,"pinecone_namespace":null,"rejection_reason":null,"rendered_pdf_url":null,"retention_date":null,"scope":"The scope includes the implementation of various modules within the Zoho system: Financial Management (setup of accounts, cash transactions, budgeting, and dashboards), VAT and Compliance (VAT configuration and reporting), Sales and Receivables (customer management and sales order processing), Purchase and Payables (vendor management and purchase tracking), Inventory and Warehouse Management (multi-location tracking and stock management), Operations and Field Service (route planning and technician tracking), Sales, Marketing, and Business Development (CRM and contract management), Project Planning and Management (milestones and budget tracking), Manpower Management (attendance and payroll integration), CRM and Customer Support (centralized database and complaint tracking), Reporting and Analytics (dashboard and KPI tracking), and Integrations (with TeleVend, Google Maps, KEKA HRMS, and banking systems). Additional features include fleet management, asset management, budgeting and forecasting, and automated approval workflows.","scope_of_work":null,"scope_of_work_introduction":null,"scope_of_work_summary":null,"start_date":null,"status":"draft","submitted_to":[],"subscription_id":"b969f7e3-6f6d-4ca7-9340-43bf0e9844ef","summary":"The proposal outlines the implementation of a fully integrated Zoho business management system for FreshNow, aimed at consolidating various business functions including finance, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, and HR. The goal is to enhance data visibility, improve efficiency, and facilitate informed decision-making across the organization. The implementation will be divided into multiple modules, each focusing on specific areas of business management, ensuring comprehensive coverage of all operational needs. Additionally, the project will include features such as automated VAT return filing, multi-currency accounting, and real-time sales reporting, among others.","team_members":[],"team_structure_min_experience":null,"team_structure_table":null,"template_id":"dfccc9d2-4ed3-44f8-a847-9704c277c264","title":"Scope of Work for Zoho Implementation (FreshNow)","total_budget":null,"training_and_support":null,"updated_at":"2026-01-28T04:50:30.561Z","updated_by":null,"version_number":1}
