cts, and HR. The goal is to enhance data visibility, improve efficiency, and facilitate informed decision-making across the organization. The implementation will be divided into multiple modules, each focusing on specific areas of business management, ensuring comprehensive coverage of all operational needs.","team_members":[{"experience":"3","role":"zoho dveloper"},{"experience":"3","role":"tester"}],"team_structure_min_experience":null,"team_structure_table":null,"template_id":"dfccc9d2-4ed3-44f8-a847-9704c277c264","title":"Scope of Work for Zoho Implementation (FreshNow)","total_budget":"0","training_and_support":null,"updated_at":"2026-01-28T04:54:28.307Z","updated_by":null,"version_number":1}
