Maps Integration:** Utilize for route and field service optimization.\n- **KEKA HRMS and Banking Systems Integration:** Ensure smooth data flow between systems.\n\n## Milestones\n- **Integrations & Analytics:** Completion of integrations and analytics functionalities.\n- **Zoho Implementation App:** Final deployment of the Zoho implementation app.\n\n## Out of Scope\n- Custom development beyond standard Zoho capabilities.\n- Additional third-party software integrations not listed in the scope.","scope_of_work_introduction":"This engagement encompasses the implementation of a fully integrated **Zoho business management system** for **FreshNow**. The project aims to consolidate various business functions such as finance, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, and HR into one cohesive platform. By utilizing Zoho's capabilities, FreshNow seeks to enhance data visibility, streamline operations, and improve overall efficiency, ultimately facilitating informed decision-making across the organization.","scope_of_work_summary":"**Key Deliverables:** Implementation of Financial Management, VAT and Compliance, Sales and Receivables, Purchase and Payables, Inventory and Warehouse Management, Operations and Field Service, CRM, Project Management, Manpower Management, Reporting and Analytics, and Integrations.\n\n**Project Duration:** January 29, 2026, to February 28, 2026.","start_date":"2026-01-29","status":"approval_pending","submitted_to":["Mr. Jain"],"subscription_id":"b969f7e3-6f6d-4ca7-9340-43bf0e9844ef","summary":"The proposal outlines the implementation of a fully integrated Zoho business management system for FreshNow, aimed at consolidating various business functions including finance, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, and HR. The goal is to enhance data visibility, improve efficiency, and facilitate informed decision-making across the organization. The implementation will be divided into multiple modules, each focusing on specific areas of business management, ensuring comprehensive coverage of all operational needs.","team_members":[{"experience":"3","role":"zoho dveloper"},{"experience":"3","role":"tester"}],"team_structure_min_experience":3,"team_structure_table":[{"Count":"1","Designation":"Zoho Developer","Experience":"3+ years","Key Responsibilities":"System configuration, module setup, integration with third-party applications, and customization of workflows."},{"Count":"1","Designation":"Tester","Experience":"3+ years","Key Responsibilities":"Quality assurance, functionality testing across all modules, and user acceptance testing."}],"template_id":"dfccc9d2-4ed3-44f8-a847-9704c277c264","title":"Scope of Work for Zoho Implementation (FreshNow)","total_budget":"0","training_and_support":"## Training Program\n\nOur engagement includes a structured training program to ensure effective use of the Zoho system:\n\n- **User Training (16 hours):** Comprehensive sessions for key stakeholders on all modules including financial management, CRM, and project planning.\n- **Admin Training (8 hours):** Focused training for administrators on system configurations, reporting tools, and compliance features.\n- **Documentation:** Detailed user manuals and quick start guides will be provided for ongoing reference.\n\n## Post-Implementation Support\n\n- 30-day support period with a dedicated team for troubleshooting and assistance.\n- Regular check-ins to assess system performance and user satisfaction.\n- Access to an online knowledge base for self-service support and updates.","updated_at":"2026-01-28T04:55:11.558Z","updated_by":null,"version_number":1},{"approval_comments":null,"approved_at":null,"approved_by":null,"audio_storage_paths":[],"billing_type":"fixed","client_email":"freshnow@gmail.com","client_name":"FreshNow","created_at":"2026-01-27T12:04:41.872Z","created_by":"9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b","currency":"USD","date_of_proposal":null,"deliverables":["Zoho CRM app"],"document_storage_paths":["216ea075-72ed-462f-a404-eb49a0918702/9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b/1769515482876-xhckeohp0.docx"],"duration_business_days":null,"end_date":"2026-02-27","executive_summary":null,"extraction_job_id":"35","extraction_progress":100,"extraction_status":"completed","goals":"The main goals of the project include: 1) Implementing a comprehensive Zoho system that integrates all business functions; 2) Ensuring compliance with UAE VAT regulations; 3) Enhancing sales and receivables management; 4) Streamlining purchasing and payables processes; 5) Improving inventory and warehouse management; 6) Optimizing operations and field service management; 7) Strengthening sales, marketing, and business development efforts; 8) Facilitating effective project planning and management; 9) Managing manpower effectively; 10) Enhancing CRM and customer support capabilities; 11) Providing robust reporting and analytics; 12) Integrating with existing systems for seamless data flow.","id":"9d98e881-0d04-4bcb-981c-6e786c466ecb","implementation_timeline_table":null,"industry":"Other","is_deleted":false,"links":[],"milestones":[{"title":"zoho app"}],"objectives":null,"parent_id":null,"pinecone_namespace":null,"rejection_reason":null,"rendered_pdf_url":null,"retention_date":null,"scope":"The scope of work includes the implementation of the following modules: 1) Financial Management - setup of accounts, management of receivables/payables, budgeting, and multi-currency accounting; 2) VAT and Compliance - VAT configuration and automated filing; 3) Sales and Receivables - management of customer data, sales orders, and reporting; 4) Purchase and Payables - vendor management and purchase processes; 5) Inventory and Warehouse Management - tracking across multiple locations and stock management; 6) Operations and Field Service - route planning and technician tracking; 7) Sales, Marketing, and Business Development - CRM for managing vending locations; 8) Project Planning and Management - project tracking and collaboration; 9) Manpower Management - integration with KEKA and management of employee data; 10) CRM and Customer Support - centralized database and complaint tracking; 11) Reporting and Analytics - consolidated dashboards and KPI tracking; 12) Integrations - connecting with TeleVend, Google Maps, KEKA HRMS, and banking systems.","scope_of_work":null,"scope_of_work_introduction":null,"scope_of_work_summary":null,"start_date":"2026-01-28","status":"failed","submitted_to":["Mr. Zara"],"subscription_id":"b969f7e3-6f6d-4ca7-9340-43bf0e9844ef","summary":"The proposal outlines the implementation of a fully integrated Zoho business management system for FreshNow, aimed at consolidating various business functions including finance, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, and HR. The primary objective is to enhance data visibility, improve operational efficiency, and facilitate informed decision-making across the organization. The implementation will cover multiple modules, each focusing on specific business areas such as financial management, VAT compliance, sales and receivables, purchasing, inventory management, operations, CRM, project management, manpower management, customer support, reporting, and integrations with existing systems.","team_members":[{"experience":"3","role":"Project Manager"}],"team_structure_min_experience":null,"team_structure_table":null,"template_id":"dfccc9d2-4ed3-44f8-a847-9704c277c264","title":"Scope of Work for Zoho Implementation (FreshNow)","total_budget":"1000","training_and_support":null,"updated_at":"2026-01-27T12:07:46.050Z","updated_by":null,"version_number":1},{"approval_comments":null,"approved_at":null,"approved_by":null,"audio_storage_paths":[],"billing_type":"fixed","client_email":"feshnow@gmail.com","client_name":"FreshNow","created_at":"2026-01-27T12:02:53.493Z","created_by":"9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b","currency":"USD","date_of_proposal":null,"deliverables":["Financial Management setup including chart of accounts and dashboards","VAT configuration and automated return filing","Sales and Receivables management system","Purchase and Payables management system","Inventory and Warehouse Management system","Operations and Field Service management system","Sales, Marketing, and Business Development CRM","Project Planning and Management tools","Manpower Management integration with KEKA","CRM and Customer Support system","Reporting and Analytics dashboards","Integrations with TeleVend, Google Maps, and banking systems"],"document_storage_paths":["216ea075-72ed-462f-a404-eb49a0918702/9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b/1769515373944-suajknzp1.docx"],"duration_business_days":null,"end_date":"2026-03-27","executive_summary":null,"extraction_job_id":"34","extraction_progress":100,"extraction_status":"completed","goals":"The main goals of the project include: 1) Implementing a comprehensive Zoho business management system that integrates all business functions; 2) Enhancing data visibility and operational efficiency; 3) Supporting informed decision-making through better data management; 4) Ensuring compliance with VAT regulations in the UAE; 5) Streamlining sales, inventory, and financial processes; 6) Improving customer relationship management and support; 7) Facilitating effective project planning and management; 8) Integrating existing systems such as TeleVend and KEKA with Zoho.","id":"0b69f9db-bab9-4c7b-8de9-d61557288202","implementation_timeline_table":null,"industry":"Retail","is_deleted":false,"links":[],"milestones":[],"objectives":null,"parent_id":null,"pinecone_namespace":null,"rejection_reason":null,"rendered_pdf_url":null,"retention_date":null,"scope":"The scope of work includes the implementation of the following modules: 1) Financial Management covering accounts setup, receivables and payables management, budgeting, and multi-currency accounting; 2) VAT and Compliance for automated VAT return filing; 3) Sales and Receivables management includi