ct tracking and collaboration; 9) Manpower Management - integration with KEKA and management of employee data; 10) CRM and Customer Support - centralized database and complaint tracking; 11) Reporting and Analytics - consolidated dashboards and KPI tracking; 12) Integrations - connecting with TeleVend, Google Maps, KEKA HRMS, and banking systems.","scope_of_work":null,"scope_of_work_introduction":null,"scope_of_work_summary":null,"start_date":"2026-01-28","status":"failed","submitted_to":["Mr. Zara"],"subscription_id":"b969f7e3-6f6d-4ca7-9340-43bf0e9844ef","summary":"The proposal outlines the implementation of a fully integrated Zoho business management system for FreshNow, aimed at consolidating various business functions including finance, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, and HR. The primary objective is to enhance data visibility, improve operational efficiency, and facilitate informed decision-making across the organization. The implementation will cover multiple modules, each focusing on specific business areas such as financial management, VAT compliance, sales and receivables, purchasing, inventory management, operations, CRM, project management, manpower management, customer support, reporting, and integrations with existing systems.","team_members":[{"experience":"3","role":"Project Manager"}],"team_structure_min_experience":null,"team_structure_table":null,"template_id":"dfccc9d2-4ed3-44f8-a847-9704c277c264","title":"Scope of Work for Zoho Implementation (FreshNow)","total_budget":"1000","training_and_support":null,"updated_at":"2026-01-27T12:07:46.050Z","updated_by":null,"version_number":1},{"approval_comments":null,"approved_at":null,"approved_by":null,"audio_storage_paths":[],"billing_type":"fixed","client_email":"feshnow@gmail.com","client_name":"FreshNow","created_at":"2026-01-27T12:02:53.493Z","created_by":"9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b","currency":"USD","date_of_proposal":null,"deliverables":["Financial Management setup including chart of accounts and dashboards","VAT configuration and automated return filing","Sales and Receivables management system","Purchase and Payables management system","Inventory and Warehouse Management system","Operations and Field Service management system","Sales, Marketing, and Business Development CRM","Project Planning and Management tools","Manpower Management integration with KEKA","CRM and Customer Support system","Reporting and Analytics dashboards","Integrations with TeleVend, Google Maps, and banking systems"],"document_storage_paths":["216ea075-72ed-462f-a404-eb49a0918702/9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b/1769515373944-suajknzp1.docx"],"duration_business_days":null,"end_date":"2026-03-27","executive_summary":null,"extraction_job_id":"34","extraction_progress":100,"extraction_status":"completed","goals":"The main goals of the project include: 1) Implementing a comprehensive Zoho business management system that integrates all business functions; 2) Enhancing data visibility and operational efficiency; 3) Supporting informed decision-making through better data management; 4) Ensuring compliance with VAT regulations in the UAE; 5) Streamlining sales, inventory, and financial processes; 6) Improving customer relationship management and support; 7) Facilitating effective project planning and management; 8) Integrating existing systems such as TeleVend and KEKA with Zoho.","id":"0b69f9db-bab9-4c7b-8de9-d61557288202","implementation_timeline_table":null,"industry":"Retail","is_deleted":false,"links":[],"milestones":[],"objectives":null,"parent_id":null,"pinecone_namespace":null,"rejection_reason":null,"rendered_pdf_url":null,"retention_date":null,"scope":"The scope of work includes the implementation of the following modules: 1) Financial Management covering accounts setup, receivables and payables management, budgeting, and multi-currency accounting; 2) VAT and Compliance for automated VAT return filing; 3) Sales and Receivables management includi