for UAE VAT compliance, automate sales and inventory workflows, and integrate real-time vending data through TeleVend. This transformation will support FreshNow in achieving operational excellence and gaining competitive advantages in the market.","extraction_job_id":null,"extraction_progress":0,"extraction_status":null,"goals":"Centralize operations, improve data visibility, automate processes, and enable informed decision making","id":"4402d1ac-8ad4-4a5a-9907-187f1e6abcf1","implementation_timeline_table":[{"phase":"Discovery & Planning","scope":"Requirements gathering, project planning, environment setup","timeline":"Feb 1 - Feb 10"},{"phase":"Financials, VAT, and Core Setup","scope":"Zoho Books configuration, VAT compliance setup","timeline":"Feb 11 - Feb 28"},{"phase":"Sales, Purchase, Inventory & CRM","scope":"Sales and inventory automation, CRM setup for vending locations","timeline":"Mar 1 - Mar 31"},{"phase":"Integrations & Analytics","scope":"TeleVend integration, consolidated analytics dashboards","timeline":"Apr 1 - Apr 30"},{"phase":"Operations & Field Service (Phase 2)","scope":"Operational management setup, Phase 2 planning","timeline":"May 1 - May 31"},{"phase":"HR Migration & Final Go-Live","scope":"HR integration with KEKA, project management tools, final deployment","timeline":"Jun 1 - Jun 30"}],"industry":"Food & Beverage / Vending Operations","is_deleted":false,"links":["https://www.zoho.com"],"milestones":[{"date":"2025-02-28","title":"Financials, VAT, and Core Setup"},{"date":"2025-03-31","title":"Sales, Purchase, Inventory & CRM"},{"date":"2025-04-30","title":"Integrations & Analytics"},{"date":"2025-05-31","title":"Operations & Field Service (Phase 2)"},{"date":"2025-06-30","title":"HR Migration & Final Go-Live"}],"objectives":"- Centralize business operations across finance, sales, inventory, and HR\n- Improve data visibility for informed decision-making\n- Automate workflows for sales, purchases, and inventory management\n- Implement CRM for managing vending locations and customer accounts\n- Establish operational management processes and project collaboration tools\n- Integrate HR functions with KEKA and migrate to Zoho People\n- Provide consolidated dashboards and analytics for performance tracking","parent_id":null,"pinecone_namespace":"proposal-4402d1ac-8ad4-4a5a-9907-187f1e6abcf1","rejection_reason":null,"rendered_pdf_url":null,"retention_date":null,"scope":"Implementation of finance, VAT, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, HR, integrations, and analytics using Zoho ecosystem","scope_of_work":"## Project Objectives\n- Implement a fully integrated Zoho business management system covering finance, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, and HR.\n- Consolidate functions for improved data visibility and efficiency.\n\n## Modules and Functional Scope\n### A. Financial Management\n- **Chart of Accounts Setup:** Configuration based on FreshNow's financial structure.\n- **Accounts Receivable and Payable Management:** Streamlined processes for tracking incoming and outgoing payments.\n- **Cash and Bank Transactions:** Management and reconciliation processes.\n- **Budgeting and Cost Center Tracking:** Implementation of budget tracking for better financial oversight.\n- **Multi-Currency and VAT Compliance:** Ensure compliance with UAE VAT regulations through Zoho Books.\n- **Dashboards:** Creation of financial dashboards for cash flow, margins, and P&L reporting.\n\n### B. VAT and Compliance\n- **VAT Configuration:** Set up for UAE FTA compliance.\n- **Automated VAT Return Filing:** Streamlining of VAT reporting processes.\n- **Audit Trail:** Maintenance of a comprehensive VAT audit trail.\n\n### C. Sales and Receivables\n- **Customer Master and Credit Control:** Centralized customer database.\n- **Sales Order Management:** Automation of the sales order, delivery, and invoicing workflows.\n- **TeleVend Integration:** Real-time data synchronization from vending machines.\n- **Sales Reporting:** Generation of customer-wise sales reports.\n\n### D. Purchases and Payables\n- **Vendor Management:** Establishment of vendor profiles and performance tracking.\n- **Purchase Order Processes:** Automation of requisition and approval workflows.\n- **Expense Allocation:** Efficient tracking of expenses and vendor reconciliation.\n\n### E. Inventory Management\n- **Multi-Location Tracking:** Management of inventory across warehouses and vending machines.\n- **Stock Management:** Alerts for stock levels and adjustments.\n- **Real-Time Integrations:** Integration with TeleVend for stock data analysis.\n\n### F. CRM and Customer Support\n- **CRM Setup:** Configuration of Zoho CRM for managing over 90 vending locations.\n- **Customer Interaction Tracking:** Integration of customer feedback and complaint tracking.\n\n### G. Operational and Field Service Management (Phase 2)\n- **Field Route Planning:** Optimization of service routes using Google Maps.\n- **Service Scheduling:** Management of technician schedules and service history.\n\n### H. HR Management\n- **KEKA Integration:** Phase 1 integration for attendance and payroll management.\n- **Migration to Zoho People:** Transitioning to Zoho People for HR functionalities.\n\n### I. Project Management and Collaboration\n- **Project Tracking:** Implementation of project and campaign management tools.\n- **Collaboration Tools:** Setup of file sharing and task assignment features.\n\n### J. Reporting and Analytics\n- **Consolidated Dashboards:** Creation of dashboards for KPI tracking across departments.\n- **Forecasting:** Implementation of forecasting tools for revenue and stock efficiency.\n\n## Out of Scope\n- Custom development outside of Zoho's standard offerings.\n- Advanced data analytics requiring external tools not integrated within Zoho.\n- Legacy data migration (separate engagement).","scope_of_work_introduction":"This proposal outlines the comprehensive implementation of a fully integrated Zoho business management system for **FreshNow Management** in the food and beverage / vending operations industry. The initiative aims to centralize operations, enhance data visibility, automate processes, and facilitate informed decision-making through the Zoho ecosystem. Our approach will align with FreshNow's goals and specific requirements to ensure a successful transformation of business processes.","scope_of_work_summary":"**Key Deliverables:** Zoho Books configuration with UAE VAT compliance, automated workflows for sales, purchases, and inventory, TeleVend integration for real-time vending data, CRM setup for managing vending locations and accounts, operational and field service management (Phase 2), HR integration with KEKA and migration to Zoho People, project management setup, and consolidated analytics dashboards.","start_date":"2025-02-01","status":"approval_pending","submitted_to":["FreshNow"],"subscription_id":"b969f7e3-6f6d-4ca7-9340-43bf0e9844ef","summary":"End-to-end Zoho business management system implementation for FreshNow","team_members":[{"experience":"8+ years","role":"Zoho Solution Architect"},{"experience":"6+ years","role":"Zoho Finance Consultant"},{"experience":"5+ years","role":"Zoho CRM & Creator Developer"},{"experience":"7+ years","role":"Project Manager"}],"team_structure_min_experience":5,"team_structure_table":[{"Count":"1","Designation":"Zoho Solution Architect","Experience":"8+ years","Key Responsibilities":"Lead implementation strategy, system architecture design, client consultation"},{"Count":"1","Designation":"Zoho Finance Consultant","Experience":"6+ years","Key Responsibilities":"Configure Zoho Books, ensure VAT compliance, financial reporting"},{"Count":"1","Designation":"Zoho CRM & Creator Developer","Experience":"5+ years","Key Responsibilities":"Develop CRM functionalities, integrate with TeleVend, customize workflows"},{"Count":"1","Designation":"Project Manager","Experience":"7+ years","Key Responsibilities":"Oversee project timelines, resource allocation, stakeholder communication"}],"template_id":"dfccc9d2-4ed3-44f8-a847-9704c277c264","title":"Zoho Implementation Proposal","total_budget":"1000","training_and_support":"## Training Plan\n\nOur implementation includes a comprehensive training program:\n\n- **Zoho System Overview (4 hours):** Introduction to the Zoho ecosystem and navigation\n- **Finance Module Training (6 hours):** Detailed sessions on Zoho Books and VAT compliance\n- **CRM Training (5 hours):** Hands-on training for CRM functionalities and best practices\n- **Operational Management Training (4 hours):** Workflow automation and field service management\n- **HR Module Training (4 hours):** Transitioning to Zoho People and using KEKA integration\n\n## Post-Implementation Support\n\n- **30-day support period:** Dedicated support with a 2-hour response time for critical issues\n- **User Guides and Documentation:** Comprehensive manuals and FAQs for all modules\n- **Access to a Client Portal:** For support ticket submissions and resources","updated_at":"2026-01-16T05:02:43.942Z","updated_by":null,"version_number":1},{"approval_comments":null,"approved_at":null,"approved_by":null,"audio_storage_paths":["https://yoxtsymyhtuhdnaszkzq.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/proposal-audio/216ea075-72ed-462f-a404-eb49a0918702/9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b/1768478158923-dpa9ixrng.mp3?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV82MTc5MjI4Mi0yYjA4LTRiZmEtYWU1Ni1lZGNkZjIyN2ZhYWUiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJwcm9wb3NhbC1hdWRpby8yMTZlYTA3NS03MmVkLTQ2MmYtYTQwNC1lYjQ5YTA5MTg3MDIvOWMzMWZlODMtOGJlNi00NjA1LWE1NDUtZWU2ZjFjZThmODhiLzE3Njg0NzgxNTg5MjMtZHBhOWl4cm5nLm1wMyIsImlhdCI6MTc2ODQ3ODE2MywiZXhwIjoxNzY4NDgxNzYzfQ.nsqkVdINNy4cGf9W3iFt-Ag2XgbQ5odPE0F3xVJ5OrU"],"billing_type":"fixed","client_email":"asdasdas@sdfsdf.dfgd","client_name":"asdasd","created_at":"2026-01-15T11:56:03.904Z","created_by":"9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b","currency":"USD","date_of_proposal":"2026