,"scope":"The scope includes the implementation of various Zoho modules: Financial Management (setup of accounts, cash transactions, budgeting), VAT and Compliance (VAT configuration and reporting), Sales and Receivables (customer management, sales order processing), Purchase and Payables (vendor management, purchase requisition), Inventory and Warehouse Management (multi-location tracking, stock alerts), Operations and Field Service (route planning, technician tracking), Sales, Marketing, and Business Development (CRM management, contract management), Project Planning and Management (project tracking, budget management), Manpower Management (attendance and payroll integration), CRM and Customer Support (customer database management), Reporting and Analytics (KPI tracking, forecasting), and Integrations (API connections with TeleVend, Google Maps, and KEKA HRMS).","scope_of_work":null,"scope_of_work_introduction":null,"scope_of_work_summary":null,"start_date":null,"status":"draft","submitted_to":[],"subscription_id":"b969f7e3-6f6d-4ca7-9340-43bf0e9844ef","summary":"The proposal outlines the implementation of a fully integrated Zoho business management system for FreshNow, aimed at enhancing data visibility, efficiency, and informed decision-making across various business functions. The project encompasses multiple modules including financial management, VAT compliance, sales and receivables, purchase and payables, inventory and warehouse management, operations and field service, sales and marketing, project planning and management, manpower management, CRM and customer support, reporting and analytics, and integrations. Each module is designed to streamline operations and improve overall business performance.","team_members":[],"team_structure_min_experience":null,"team_structure_table":null,"template_id":"dfccc9d2-4ed3-44f8-a847-9704c277c264","title":"Scope of Work for Zoho Implementation (FreshNow)","total_budget":null,"training_and_support":null,"updated_at":"2026-01-28T04:59:10.189Z","updated_by":null,"version_number":1},{"approval_comments":null,"approved_at":null,"approved_by":null,"audio_storage_paths":["216ea075-72ed-462f-a404-eb49a0918702/9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b/1769575651394-ehqyzwvmb.mp3"],"billing_type":"fixed","client_email":"info@freshnow.com","client_name":"FreshNow","created_at":"2026-01-28T04:46:59.242Z","created_by":"9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b","currency":"USD","date_of_proposal":null,"deliverables":["Financial Management setup including chart of accounts and dashboards","VAT configuration and automated return filing","Sales and receivables management system","Purchase and payables management system","Inventory and warehouse management system","Operations and field service management system","Sales, marketing, and business development CRM","Project planning and management tools","Manpower management integration with KEKA","CRM and customer support system","Reporting and analytics dashboards","Integrations with TeleVend API, Google Maps, KEKA HRMS, and banking systems","Fleet management system for vehicle tracking and maintenance scheduling","Asset management module for tracking machines and resources","Automated approval workflows for contract management and refunds"],"document_storage_paths":["216ea075-72ed-462f-a404-eb49a0918702/9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b/1769575617824-f8sce5ymv.docx"],"duration_business_days":30,"end_date":"2026-02-28","executive_summary":"This proposal outlines our approach to implementing a **fully integrated Zoho business management system** for **FreshNow**, aimed at consolidating key business functions such as finance, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, and HR. By enhancing data visibility and improving operational efficiency, FreshNow will be better equipped to make informed decisions that drive growth and streamline processes.\n\nThe implementation will be organized into multiple modules, each tailored to address specific operational needs. This comprehensive approach ensures that all aspects of the business are covered, facilitating seamless integration and collaboration across departments. Our goal is to not only improve the daily operations but also to empower FreshNow with tools for strategic growth and customer engagement as the business evolves.","extraction_job_id":"39","extraction_progress":100,"extraction_status":"completed","goals":"The primary objective is to implement a fully integrated Zoho system that consolidates functions for improved data visibility and efficiency. Specific goals include setting up financial management systems, ensuring VAT compliance, managing sales and receivables, optimizing purchase and payables processes, enhancing inventory and warehouse management, and improving operations and field service capabilities. Additionally, the project aims to strengthen sales, marketing, and business development efforts, streamline project planning and management, and enhance manpower management and customer support functionalities.","id":"9a43f7cb-1ff3-473d-a542-b7a3d9031c0a","implementation_timeline_table":[{"phase":"Discovery & Planning","scope":"Requirements gathering, stakeholder interviews, initial project planning","timeline":"Jan 29 - Feb 4"},{"phase":"System Design & Configuration","scope":"Design of Financial Management, VAT compliance setup, configuration of Sales and Receivables management","timeline":"Feb 5 - Feb 10"},{"phase":"Purchase & Payables Setup","scope":"Implementation of Purchase and Payables system, integration with existing processes","timeline":"Feb 11 - Feb 15"},{"phase":"Inventory & Operations Setup","scope":"Implementation of Inventory management and Operations setup, Field Service integration","timeline":"Feb 16 - Feb 20"},{"phase":"CRM & Customer Support System Implementation","scope":"Setup of CRM and Customer Support system, initial user training","timeline":"Feb 21 - Feb 25"},{"phase":"Project Planning & Management Tools Setup","scope":"Implementation of Project Planning and Management tools, integration with existing workflows","timeline":"Feb 24 - Feb 26"},{"phase":"Manpower Management Integration","scope":"Integration of Manpower Management system, final adjustments and testing","timeline":"Feb 27 - Feb 28"}],"industry":"Other","is_deleted":false,"links":["https://gitlab.techwarelab.com/"],"milestones":[{"title":"Integrations & Analytics"},{"title":"Zoho Implementation app"}],"objectives":"- Implement a fully integrated Zoho system for enhanced data visibility and efficiency\n- Set up financial management systems ensuring VAT compliance\n- Manage sales and receivables effectively to boost cash flow\n- Optimize purchase and payables processes for better vendor management\n- Enhance inventory and warehouse management with multi-location tracking\n- Improve operations and field service capabilities to increase responsiveness\n- Strengthen sales, marketing, and business development efforts through effective CRM\n- Streamline project planning and management with milestone tracking\n- Enhance manpower management and customer support functionalities","parent_id":null,"pinecone_namespace":"proposal-9a43f7cb-1ff3-473d-a542-b7a3d9031c0a","rejection_reason":null,"rendered_pdf_url":null,"retention_date":null,"scope":"The scope includes the implementation of various modules within the Zoho system: Financial Management (setup of accounts, cash transactions, budgeting, and dashboards), VAT and Compliance (VAT configuration and reporting), Sales and Receivables (customer management and sales order processing), Purchase and Payables (vendor management and purchase tracking), Inventory and Warehouse Management (multi-location tracking and stock management), Operations and Field Service (route planning and technician tracking), Sales, Marketing, and Business Development (CRM and contract management), Project Planning and Management (milestones and budget tracking), Manpower Management (attendance and payroll integration), CRM and Customer Support (centralized database and complaint tracking), Reporting and Analytics (dashboard and KPI tracking), and Integrations (with TeleVend, Google Maps, KEKA HRMS, and banking systems).","scope_of_work":"## Project Objectives\n- Implement a fully integrated Zoho system covering all major business functions.\n- Enhance data visibility and operational efficiency.\n- Facilitate informed decision-making through comprehensive reporting.\n\n## Modules and Functional Scope\n### A. Financial Management\n- **Chart of Accounts Setup:** Establish a structured chart for accounts management.\n- **Accounts Receivable and Payable Management:** Streamline cash flow through effective tracking.\n- **Cash and Bank Transactions:** Facilitate reconciliation of transactions.\n- **Budgeting and Cost Center Tracking:** Implement budgeting processes and track costs.\n- **Fixed Asset Management:** Monitor and manage fixed assets.\n- **Multi-Currency and VAT Compliant Accounting:** Ensure compliance with UAE regulations.\n- **Dashboards:** Create dashboards for cash flow, margins, and P&L using Zoho Books and Zoho Analytics.\n\n### B. VAT and Compliance\n- **VAT Configuration:** Set up VAT according to UAE FTA compliance.\n- **Automated VAT Return Filing:** Automate the VAT return processes and reporting.\n- **Audit Trail and Reconciliation:** Maintain an audit trail for VAT transactions.\n\n### C. Sales and Receivables\n- **Customer Management:** Implement customer master data management.\n- **Sales Order Processing:** Manage sales orders efficiently.\n- **Automatic TeleVend Data Sync:** Sync data from vending machines in real-time.\n- **Real-Time Sales Reporting:** Provide insights into sales performance.\n\n### D. Purchase and Payables\n- **Vendor Management:** Streamline vendor onboarding and management.\n- **Purchase Requisition and Approval Process:** Automate purchase requisition workflows.\n- **Goods Receipt Tracking:** Manage receipt of goods and returns efficiently.\n- **Supplier Performance Analytics:** Track and analyze supplier performance.\n\n### E. Inventory and Warehouse Management\n- **Multi-Location Tracking:** Implement tracking across warehouses and vending machines.\n- **Stock Transfers and Adjustments:** Manage stock movements and adjustments.\n- **Batch and Serial Number Tracking:** Monitor inventory with batch and serial numbers.\n- **Stock Level Alerts:** Set up alerts for stock levels and refill needs.\n\n### F. Operations and Field Service\n- **Field Route Planning:** Optimize field operations using Google Maps.\n- **Machine Service Scheduling:** Schedule and track service history for machines.\n- **Technician Task Tracking:** Monitor technician tasks with photo capture.\n\n### G. Sales, Marketing, and Business Development\n- **CRM Implementation:** Develop a CRM to manage over 90 vending locations.\n- **Contract Management:** Automate the management of contracts and SLAs.\n- **Campaign Management:** Implement tools for tracking marketing campaigns.\n\n### H. Project Planning and Management\n- **Project Planning Tools:** Set milestones and budgets for projects.\n- **Technical and Operational Tracking:** Monitor project progress and team collaboration.\n\n### I. Manpower Management\n- **KEKA Integration:** Integrate attendance, payroll, and employee data into Zoho.\n- **Shift Scheduling and Route Assignments:** Manage staff schedules and assignments.\n\n### J. CRM and Customer Support\n- **Centralized Database:** Create a centralized lead and customer database.\n- **Complaint and Feedback Tracking:** Implement a system for tracking customer feedback.\n\n### K. Reporting and Analytics\n- **Consolidated Dashboards:** Provide dashboards for KPIs across departments.\n- **Custom Visual Reports:** Generate role-based reports for analysis.\n\n### L. Integrations\n- **TeleVend API:** Integrate vending data for real-time insights.\n- **Google Maps Integration:** Utilize for route and field service optimization.\n- **KEKA HRMS and Banking Systems Integration:** Ensure smooth data flow between systems.\n\n## Milestones\n- **Integrations & Analytics:** Completion of integrations and analytics functionalities.\n- **Zoho Implementation App:** Final deployment of the Zoho implementation app.\n\n## Out of Scope\n- Custom development beyond standard Zoho capabilities.\n- Additional third-party software integrations not listed in the scope.","scope_of_work_introduction":"This engagement encompasses the implementation of a fully integrated **Zoho business management system** for **FreshNow**. The project aims to consolidate various business functions such as finance, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, and HR into one cohesive platform. By utilizing Zoho's capabilities, FreshNow seeks to enhance data visibility, streamline operations, and improve overall efficiency, ultimately facilitating informed decision-making across the organization.","scope_of_work_summary":"**Key Deliverables:** Implementation of Financial Management, VAT and Compliance, Sales and Receivables, Purchase and Payables, Inventory and Warehouse Management, Operations and Field Service, CRM, Project Management, Manpower Management, Reporting and Analytics, and Integrations.\n\n**Project Duration:** January 29, 2026, to February 28, 2026.","start_date":"2026-01-29","status":"approval_pending","submitted_to":["Mr. Jain"],"subscription_id":"b969f7e3-6f6d-4ca7-9340-43bf0e9844ef","summary":"The proposal outlines the implementation of a fully integrated Zoho business management system for FreshNow, aimed at consolidating various business functions including finance, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, and HR. The goal is to enhance data visibility, improve efficiency, and facilitate informed decision-making across the organization. The implementation will be divided into multiple modules, each focusing on specific areas of business management, ensuring comprehensive coverage of all operational needs.","team_members":[{"experience":"3","role":"zoho dveloper"},{"experience":"3","role":"tester"}],"team_structure_min_experience":3,"team_structure_table":[{"Count":"1","Designation":"Zoho Developer","Experience":"3+ years","Key Responsibilities":"System configuration, module setup, integration with third-party applications, and customization of workflows."},{"Count":"1","Designation":"Tester","Experience":"3+ years","Key Responsibilities":"Quality assurance, functionality testing across all modules, and user acceptance testing."}],"template_id":"dfccc9d2-4ed3-44f8-a847-9704c277c264","title":"Scope of Work for Zoho Implementation (FreshNow)","total_budget":"0","training_and_support":"## Training Program\n\nOur engagement includes a structured training program to ensure effective use of the Zoho system:\n\n- **User Training (16 hours):** Comprehensive sessions for key stakeholders on all modules including financial management, CRM, and project planning.\n- **Admin Training (8 hours):** Focused training for administrators on system configurations, reporting tools, and compliance features.\n- **Documentation:** Detailed user manuals and quick start guides will be provided for ongoing reference.\n\n## Post-Implementation Support\n\n- 30-day support period with a dedicated team for troubleshooting and assistance.\n- Regular check-ins to assess system performance and user satisfaction.\n- Access to an online knowledge base for self-service support and updates.","updated_at":"2026-01-28T04:55:11.558Z","updated_by":null,"version_number":1},{"approval_comments":null,"approved_at":null,"approved_by":null,"audio_storage_paths":[],"billing_type":"fixed","client_email":"freshnow@gmail.com","client_name":"FreshNow","created_at":"2026-01-27T12:04:41.872Z","created_by":"9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b","currency":"USD","date_of_proposal":null,"deliverables":["Zoho CRM app"],"document_storage_paths":["216ea075-72ed-462f-a404-eb49a0918702/9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a5