em","Inventory and Warehouse Management system","Operations and Field Service management system","Sales, Marketing, and Business Development CRM","Project Planning and Management tools","Manpower Management integration with KEKA","CRM and Customer Support system","Reporting and Analytics dashboards","Integrations with TeleVend, Google Maps, and banking systems"],"document_storage_paths":["216ea075-72ed-462f-a404-eb49a0918702/9c31fe83-8be6-4605-a545-ee6f1ce8f88b/1769515373944-suajknzp1.docx"],"duration_business_days":null,"end_date":"2026-03-27","executive_summary":null,"extraction_job_id":"34","extraction_progress":100,"extraction_status":"completed","goals":"The main goals of the project include: 1) Implementing a comprehensive Zoho business management system that integrates all business functions; 2) Enhancing data visibility and operational efficiency; 3) Supporting informed decision-making through better data management; 4) Ensuring compliance with VAT regulations in the UAE; 5) Streamlining sales, inventory, and financial processes; 6) Improving customer relationship management and support; 7) Facilitating effective project planning and management; 8) Integrating existing systems such as TeleVend and KEKA with Zoho.","id":"0b69f9db-bab9-4c7b-8de9-d61557288202","implementation_timeline_table":null,"industry":"Retail","is_deleted":false,"links":[],"milestones":[],"objectives":null,"parent_id":null,"pinecone_namespace":null,"rejection_reason":null,"rendered_pdf_url":null,"retention_date":null,"scope":"The scope of work includes the implementation of the following modules: 1) Financial Management covering accounts setup, receivables and payables management, budgeting, and multi-currency accounting; 2) VAT and Compliance for automated VAT return filing; 3) Sales and Receivables management including customer control and sales reporting; 4) Purchase and Payables for vendor management and expense tracking; 5) Inventory and Warehouse Management with multi-location tracking and stock alerts; 6) Operations and Field Service for route planning and technician tracking; 7) Sales, Marketing, and Business Development for CRM and contract management; 8) Project Planning and Management for tracking projects and budgets; 9) Manpower Management integrating attendance and payroll; 10) CRM and Customer Support for centralized customer database; 11) Reporting and Analytics for KPI tracking and forecasting; 12) Integrations with TeleVend API, Google Maps, KEKA HRMS, and banking systems.","scope_of_work":null,"scope_of_work_introduction":null,"scope_of_work_summary":null,"start_date":"2026-01-28","status":"draft","submitted_to":[],"subscription_id":"b969f7e3-6f6d-4ca7-9340-43bf0e9844ef","summary":"The proposal outlines the implementation of a fully integrated Zoho business management system for FreshNow, aimed at consolidating various business functions including finance, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, and HR. The primary objective is to enhance data visibility, improve operational efficiency, and support informed decision-making. The implementation will cover multiple modules such as Financial Management, VAT and Compliance, Sales and Receivables, Purchase and Payables, Inventory and Warehouse Management, Operations and Field Service, Sales and Marketing, Project Planning and Management, Manpower Management, CRM and Customer Support, Reporting and Analytics, and Integrations. Each module will utilize specific Zoho applications to achieve the desired outcomes.","team_members":[],"team_structure_min_experience":null,"team_structure_table":null,"template_id":"dfccc9d2-4ed3-44f8-a847-9704c277c264","title":"Scope of Work for Zoho Implementation (FreshNow)","total_budget":"10000","training_and_support":null,"updated_at":"2026-01-27T12:03:45.348Z","updated_by":null,"version_number":1}]}
