ing and stock alerts; 6) Operations and Field Service for route planning and technician tracking; 7) Sales, Marketing, and Business Development for CRM and contract management; 8) Project Planning and Management for tracking projects and budgets; 9) Manpower Management integrating attendance and payroll; 10) CRM and Customer Support for centralized customer database; 11) Reporting and Analytics for KPI tracking and forecasting; 12) Integrations with TeleVend API, Google Maps, KEKA HRMS, and banking systems.","scope_of_work":null,"scope_of_work_introduction":null,"scope_of_work_summary":null,"start_date":"2026-01-28","status":"draft","submitted_to":[],"subscription_id":"b969f7e3-6f6d-4ca7-9340-43bf0e9844ef","summary":"The proposal outlines the implementation of a fully integrated Zoho business management system for FreshNow, aimed at consolidating various business functions including finance, sales, purchases, inventory, CRM, operations, projects, and HR. The primary objective is to enhance data visibility, improve operational efficiency, and support informed decision-making. The implementation will cover multiple modules such as Financial Management, VAT and Compliance, Sales and Receivables, Purchase and Payables, Inventory and Warehouse Management, Operations and Field Service, Sales and Marketing, Project Planning and Management, Manpower Management, CRM and Customer Support, Reporting and Analytics, and Integrations. Each module will utilize specific Zoho applications to achieve the desired outcomes.","team_members":[],"team_structure_min_experience":null,"team_structure_table":null,"template_id":"dfccc9d2-4ed3-44f8-a847-9704c277c264","title":"Scope of Work for Zoho Implementation (FreshNow)","total_budget":"10000","training_and_support":null,"updated_at":"2026-01-27T12:03:45.348Z","updated_by":null,"version_number":1}]}
